# AGENTS.md - Project Skills Configuration

This file follows OpenCode conventions for defining project-scoped skills.

## Skills

### Skill: code_review
Automatically review code changes for quality, security, and best practices.

**Triggers**: review, code review, check code, audit code

**Agents**: coder, review

### Skill: test_generation
Generate comprehensive tests for code changes.

**Triggers**: test, tests, testing, unit test, integration test

**Agents**: coder, test

### Skill: refactoring
Refactor code following project patterns and best practices.

**Triggers**: refactor, refactoring, improve code, clean up

**Agents**: coder

## Rules

Project-specific rules are defined in `.claude/rules/` directory:
- `.claude/rules/manifest-policy.md` - Core project policy (Tier 0)
- `.claude/rules/code-style.md` - Code style guidelines
- `.claude/rules/security.md` - Security best practices

## Usage

Skills defined here are automatically available to agents when working on this project.
Agent-specific skills can be configured in `.manifest/agent_config.json`.
